.TH SETUP 8 "November 2026" "kryx-linux" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
setup \- scriptable KryX Linux rootfs bootstrapper
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B setup
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B setup
bootstraps a KryX Linux installation into a mounted target root directory
(default
.IR /mnt )
using the static
.BR pe (8)
binary.
Because it has no TUI or distro\-specific dependencies, it runs cleanly from any
x86_64 live Linux ISO (including CRUX, Arch, Debian, Fedora, and Alpine live
environments).
For an interactive
.BR dialog (1)
TUI installer (including hybrid offline CRUX ISO + online KryX overlay mode),
see
.BR setup\-kryx (8).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-root \fIdir\fR
Mounted target root filesystem directory (default:
.IR /mnt ).
.TP
.B \-\-profile \fIname\fR
Package set to install:
.BR minimal
(barebones rootfs +
.B pe
+
.BR gports ),
.BR base
(bootable minimal system + kernel + networking; default), or
.BR devel
(base + C/C++/Go toolchain ready to build ports out of the box).
.TP
.B \-\-extra "\fIpkg1 pkg2 ...\fR"
Additional space\-separated binary packages to install.
.TP
.B \-\-repo \fIowner/repo\fR
GitHub repository slug hosting rolling binaries (default:
.BR kryx-linux/ports ).
.TP
.B \-\-tag \fItag\fR
Target binary release tag (default:
.BR rolling\-x86_64 ).
.TP
.B \-\-arch \fIarch\fR
Target architecture (default:
.BR x86_64 ).
.TP
.B \-\-hostname \fIname\fR
Hostname written to
.I <root>/etc/hostname
(default:
.BR kryx ).
.TP
.B \-\-timezone \fItz\fR
Timezone path under
.I /usr/share/zoneinfo
linked to
.I <root>/etc/localtime
(default:
.BR UTC ).
.TP
.B \-\-key \fIfile|url\fR
Optional Ed25519 public key trusted via
.B pe key trust
and enabling
.B verify_signature = true
in
.IR pe.ini .
.TP
.B \-\-pe\-bin \fIpath\fR
Explicit path to the static
.B pe
binary.
.TP
.B \-\-dry\-run
Initialize config skeleton and print resolved plan without syncing or installing packages.
.TP
.BR \-y ", " \-\-yes
Skip the interactive confirmation prompt (for automated scripts and ISO builders).
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.PP
.nf
setup \-\-root /mnt \-\-profile base \-\-hostname mykryx \-\-timezone UTC
setup \-\-root /mnt \-\-profile devel \-\-extra "vim tmux" \-\-yes
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR setup\-kryx (8),
.BR setup\-chroot (8),
.BR setup\-repo (8),
.BR pe (8),
.BR gports (8)
